# Classic Host / Assets (gated)

**Scope ထဲ:**
- Full Width WP, SPA host, canvas clip
- SiteAssets, CSP
- chrome On/Off
- bulk baseline wave

---

## Load order (ဖတ်ရမည့် အစဉ်)

1. **Bulk all pages / wired baseline** → `bulk-classic-to-spfx-baseline/SKILL.md` + `docs/migration/`
2. **Otherwise** → `classic-to-spfx-migration/SKILL.md`
3. **References load:**
   - `visual-typography.md` — **required** (typography self-check, `classic-visual-parity` တွဲ)
   - `host-modes.md` — full-width / SPA / 450px clip
   - `site-chrome.md` — Site Pages chrome hide
   - `siteassets-gotchas.md` — images/vendor/CSP/remount

---

## This repo (DBS-FFW)

- **One web part per classic page** — hub `pageKey` router **မသုံး**
- Classic chrome = **inline per ASPX** — `ui-loader` / PortalShell AC **မသုံး** (user မတောင်းမှ)
- Data = **`SPHttpClient`**; `@pnp/sp` = ask-first
- Visual SoT = `classic-visual-parity` + `uikit-to-spfx-visual-parity`

---

## Reject (မလုပ်ရ)

- Yeoman/Heft into classic ASPX root
- `blob:` classic script boot
- Hardcoded `/sites/…` URLs
- Fluent restyle before Visual PASS
